#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectphaser.rst:16 2b5f01684d394763a1aee15c9a6aaaed
msgid "Phaser effect using flanger DSP for sweeping filter effects."
msgstr "移相器效果。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectphaser.rst:21 88b40fc585a941258ce053238b10379b
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectphaser.rst:23 918d070ccb014eb39899e99e1186e8eb
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectPhaser creates a phaser effect by using FMOD's flange DSP. It produces a sweeping "
"filter effect by modulating the frequency range of all-pass filters."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectPhaser**    通过扫频相位偏移制造流动、旋转或镂空的调制音色。   ``range_min_hz``    与    ``range_max_hz``"
"    控制扫频范围，   ``rate_hz``    控制移动速度，   ``depth``    与    ``feedback``    控制效果强度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectphaser.rst:25 5a27898c4cc440e09c6db088e81b8ea1
msgid ""
"Note: While phasers and flangers have different underlying principles, this implementation uses "
"flanger DSP to approximate phaser-like effects. Use this effect to add movement, space, and "
"character to audio."
msgstr "此实现使用镶边 DSP 近似移相效果，可为音频增加运动感和空间感。"

